{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a first-person platform puzzle game somewhat similar to <strong>Portal 1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, a <strong>mirror</strong> is like a door. By opening this door, you will be able to travel between two spaces that are mirror images of each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will acquire the ability to open the mirror through &quot;<strong>light</strong>&quot; and use this ability to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meanwhile, you will experience a <strong>dark story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Salute to Portal 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this trial version, you will use common puzzle elements in Portal, such as Cube and Energy Pellet. The Jump pads will appear in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Rich plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this trial version, you will experience a part of a story full of suspense. The story is presented in the form of static models, text and small sound effects of the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Realistic style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a 3D realistic art style with eerie scene atmospheres and a touch of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty is relatively low. You should be able to clear it smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Mini-games within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will also experience a short dimension shift platform jumping mini-game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672030?t=1747356444","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3672030?t=1747356444","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672030/de97dec09cc67c9354ad8f50839a6f721ce914fb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747356444","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3672030/de97dec09cc67c9354ad8f50839a6f721ce914fb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747356444","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"bloodstain and skeleton"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a first-person platform puzzle game somewhat similar to <strong>Portal 1</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the game, a <strong>mirror</strong> is like a door. By opening this door, you will be able to travel between two spaces that are mirror images of each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will acquire the ability to open the mirror through &quot;<strong>light</strong>&quot; and use this ability to solve puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meanwhile, you will experience a <strong>dark story</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Salute to Portal 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this trial version, you will use common puzzle elements in Portal, such as Cube and Energy Pellet. The Jump pads will appear in the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Rich plot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this trial version, you will experience a part of a story full of suspense. The story is presented in the form of static models, text and small sound effects of the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. Realistic style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features a 3D realistic art style with eerie scene atmospheres and a touch of horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4. Difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The difficulty is relatively low. You should be able to clear it smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">5. Mini-games within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you will also experience a short dimension shift platform jumping mini-game.</p>","developers":["Micractive"],"fullgame":